lock}}\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#6B7A88;\">Project type</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:20px; color:#33414D;\">{{1.select_1}}</td></tr>\n{{20.filesBlock}}\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0 32px; font-family:'Poppins','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:17px; line-height:24px; font-weight:600; color:#17324B;\">What happens next</h2>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 12px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#1E7A4B; font-weight:600; width:20px;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#33414D;\">We review your plans and project details.</td></tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 12px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#1E7A4B; font-weight:600;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#33414D;\">We send you a fixed-fee quotation setting out exactly what's included.</td></tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#1E7A4B; font-weight:600;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#33414D;\">Once you're happy, you accept online and we begin your drawings.</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 32px 32px; font-family:'Poppins','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#33414D;\">If anything about your project changes in the meantime, just reply to this email and quote your reference.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#33414D;\">Kind regards,<br><span style=\"color:#17324B; font-weight:600;\">The BuildRegs Team</span></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px 24px 32px; border-top:1px solid #E3E8ED; font-family:'Poppins','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:19px; color:#6B7A88;\">BuildRegs &middot; Building Regulations drawings &amp; structural calculations<br><a href=\"https://buildregs.co.uk\" style=\"color:#17324B; text-decoration:underline;\">buildregs.co.uk</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:support@buildregs.co.uk\" style=\"color:#17324B; text-decoration:underline;\">support@buildregs.co.uk</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>",
